  "ruleText": "Lot 7102.11 “Game form number” means the unique, manufacturer-designated number or alphanumeric code that identifies the game name, cost per play, ticket count, payout structure, and extended payout structure.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Lot 7100) #13068, eff 6-27-20; ss by #13913, eff 3-22-24 (formerly Lot 7102.08)",
